@startuml expense-states
' SplitSmart - Expense lifecycle (shared). Source of truth: data-model.md section 6.1.
title SplitSmart - Expense State Machine

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> PENDING : submit\n[active member; validation passes]\n/ store shares; notify other members
PENDING --> PENDING : edit\n[actor = submitter; version matches]\n/ recompute shares
PENDING --> APPROVED : approve\n[ReviewPolicy allows; version matches]\n/ ReviewDecision; notify parties
PENDING --> REJECTED : reject\n[ReviewPolicy allows; version matches]\n/ ReviewDecision; notify parties
APPROVED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]

PENDING : excluded from balances
APPROVED : included in balances (immutable)
REJECTED : never in balances (immutable)
@enduml
